          "body": "Questions for next week’s refinement:\nShowing the banner on PDP/PLP - would it ever be a specific category / product and others not? Or is it: it either shows on all PLPs / all PDPs or none?\nIs the banner global, except on Zimmerse? Can we get some information on the rules - where to show and where not to show, even though we understand it must be flexible - it may impact the way we design it if we can get a bit more info on this\nGet thoughts on having a distinct pause-on-hover or dedicated pause control separate from close for accessibility - see Tim’s comment below.",
