        },
        {
          "id": "13400",
          "body": "Design team needs to show:\nPause on hover (not yet designed - motion design) / Stop / Hide\nPosition on the page - above and below the header\nShowing the banner on PDP/PLP - would it ever be a specific category / product and others not? Or is it: it either shows on all PLPs / all PDPs or none?\nIf we can have it, yes. Specific SKUs or collections",
